# Implementation plan — Spec 1.9.3

## Summary

Reusable **`UserSelectionDialog`** in `@webonone/ui-kit`: `CustomDialog` shell, debounced search, optional role filter, infinite scroll via injectable `loadUsers`, single-select `onSelect`. Showcase demo on Dialogs tab; WebOnOne reference consumer with mock loader. See [02-ui-kit-user-selection-dialog.md](./02-ui-kit-user-selection-dialog.md), [03-showcase-dialogs-demo.md](./03-showcase-dialogs-demo.md), [04-service-integration.md](./04-service-integration.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.9.3` |
| Package builds | `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` before consumer prod builds |

