## Phase 1 — UI Kit UserSelectionDialog

**Goal:** Component + types + export.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Dialog component | `ui-kit/package/src/components/UserSelectionDialog.tsx` |
| Export | `ui-kit/package/src/index.ts` |

**Exit criteria:** Infinite scroll, search debounce, role filter, row select closes dialog.

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root`

